{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03603","headline":"天官崔侍郎夫人吴氏挽歌 · 李峤","name":"天官崔侍郎夫人吴氏挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宠服当年盛，芳魂此地穷。\n劒飞龙匣在，人去鹊巢空。\n簟怆孤生竹，琴哀半死桐。\n唯当青史上，千载仰嫔风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}